WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.260 --> 00:39.860
=Episode 2=

00:39.860 --> 00:42.780
(Subduing Princess, Startling Aunt)

00:42.980 --> 00:49.540
(Juxian Restaurant)

00:52.860 --> 00:53.980
I wonder which run-down

00:53.980 --> 00:55.220
(Xiu, Lin Luo's personal maid)
restaurant the Young Master bought.

00:55.220 --> 00:56.420
How are we supposed to find it?

00:56.700 --> 00:58.660
That guy knows nothing about business.

00:59.420 --> 01:01.660
Just look for the place
with the worst business.

01:01.700 --> 01:02.590
We'll surely find him.

01:03.180 --> 01:04.300
No need to look at this one.

01:04.300 --> 01:05.100
Let's split up.

01:05.340 --> 01:05.860
Go.

01:08.460 --> 01:10.500
How come it's been this long,
and I'm still not up?

01:10.700 --> 01:11.660
That's nothing.

01:11.660 --> 01:12.620
I've been waiting for two hours.

01:12.620 --> 01:13.990
(Could it be that all these people)

01:14.020 --> 01:15.620
(are here to challenge Wei the Fool?)

01:17.830 --> 01:18.940
Please don't push, everyone.

01:18.950 --> 01:19.780
Take a number first.

01:19.780 --> 01:20.660
One at a time.

01:21.600 --> 01:22.890
The line starts back there, ma'am.

01:22.900 --> 01:23.920
We're looking for someone.

01:24.740 --> 01:25.740
Don't crowd! One by one!

01:25.740 --> 01:28.100
(Since when did Great Yong
have such a popular restaurant?)

01:29.940 --> 01:31.660
How did this guy come up with this?

01:39.060 --> 01:40.220
Minister Duan?

01:40.980 --> 01:41.860
And you are...

01:42.020 --> 01:42.820
It's me.

01:46.140 --> 01:47.460
Didn't you come here

01:47.540 --> 01:49.060
to challenge Wei Hao in arithmetic?

01:49.060 --> 01:50.260
Why are you eating?

01:50.460 --> 01:51.180
Also,

01:51.420 --> 01:53.140
what is all of this about?

01:54.260 --> 01:55.180
Your Highness,

01:55.740 --> 01:58.020
after I lost to Wei Hao last time,

01:58.020 --> 01:59.480
the more I thought about it,
the angrier I got.

01:59.540 --> 02:02.100
So I brought my colleagues
to challenge him.

02:02.100 --> 02:02.900
As a result,

02:03.500 --> 02:05.500
we've been losing
for three consecutive days.

02:06.340 --> 02:06.860
Three...

02:06.860 --> 02:08.460
Fortunately, he lets those of us who lost

02:08.460 --> 02:09.700
eat hotpot for free.

02:10.500 --> 02:11.660
He also gave us a so-called

02:12.540 --> 02:14.580
three-day VIP membership.

02:15.500 --> 02:16.460
It's amazing.

02:16.740 --> 02:18.140
Once you start, you can't stop.

02:18.140 --> 02:19.140
I come to eat every day.

02:19.460 --> 02:20.340
Anything else

02:20.500 --> 02:21.900
tastes like sawdust now.

02:22.220 --> 02:23.140
I feel

02:23.460 --> 02:25.260
like I've been set up.

02:25.540 --> 02:27.340
You've already lost for three days?

02:28.460 --> 02:29.460
I am ashamed.

02:29.980 --> 02:31.020
Even my secret savings

02:31.420 --> 02:32.260
are all gone.

02:33.980 --> 02:34.780
Next.

02:35.680 --> 02:36.700
Let me try one more time.

02:36.860 --> 02:38.300
I don't believe I can't win it back.

02:39.060 --> 02:40.180
It's you again?

02:40.380 --> 02:42.540
Are you going to give me
another child's problem?

02:43.380 --> 02:45.380
This is a problem
I spent all night thinking of.

02:46.020 --> 02:47.800
You've already lost
ten guan to me, you know?

02:49.820 --> 02:50.940
You solved it just like that?

02:52.140 --> 02:52.460
This...

02:52.900 --> 02:53.940
You're now a VIP.

02:53.940 --> 02:54.790
Go to a private room.

02:55.380 --> 02:56.180
Private room?

02:57.820 --> 02:58.220
Dear,

02:58.220 --> 02:58.980
you're here.

03:00.380 --> 03:01.940
You recognized me so easily?

03:03.420 --> 03:04.020
Insolent.

03:04.220 --> 03:05.420
Call me that again, and I'll...

03:05.500 --> 03:06.300
Don't be angry.

03:06.380 --> 03:07.780
Anger causes wrinkles.

03:07.780 --> 03:08.500
It's not pretty.

03:09.220 --> 03:11.300
(Why should I argue with a fool?)

03:11.940 --> 03:13.820
Did you win all of this?

03:16.140 --> 03:17.500
One guan per problem.

03:17.940 --> 03:19.620
Those people you found are no good.

03:19.820 --> 03:20.820
They're ill-tempered

03:20.820 --> 03:21.500
and stubborn.

03:21.700 --> 03:23.060
They keep coming back after losing.

03:23.180 --> 03:25.300
I've made almost a thousand
guan these past few days.

03:25.420 --> 03:26.020
I'm exhausted.

03:26.020 --> 03:26.900
A thousand guan?

03:29.540 --> 03:30.340
So, how about it?

03:30.340 --> 03:31.900
We had a deal.

03:32.380 --> 03:34.020
If you can't beat me, you'll marry me.

03:34.020 --> 03:35.940
If you say that again,
I'll seal your mouth shut.

03:35.940 --> 03:36.740
Have you eaten yet?

03:37.980 --> 03:38.540
No.

03:38.540 --> 03:39.620
Do you like hotpot?

03:42.620 --> 03:43.620
Eat slowly.

03:43.700 --> 03:45.060
You're a princess, after all.

03:46.300 --> 03:47.500
Take your time.

03:47.940 --> 03:48.740
From now on,

03:48.780 --> 03:50.780
this private room
will be reserved just for you.

03:52.500 --> 03:53.060
Wei the Fool,

03:53.860 --> 03:55.700
how dare you use me!

03:56.200 --> 03:57.980
Don't think I don't know
what you're up to.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.460
You provoked
the civil and military officials

03:59.460 --> 04:00.980
to compete in arithmetic with you here

04:01.380 --> 04:03.060
just to hype up
Juxian Restaurant, right?

04:04.140 --> 04:05.060
Since that's the case,

04:05.140 --> 04:07.100
you must give me an explanation.

04:07.660 --> 04:08.460
What explanation?

04:08.780 --> 04:09.580
One thousand guan.

04:10.000 --> 04:11.900
I'm buying half of
your shares in Juxian Restaurant.

04:12.420 --> 04:14.300
Why do you want my restaurant so badly?

04:15.500 --> 04:16.700
Can't I just be short on money?

04:17.000 --> 04:19.020
You're a princess.
How could you be short on money?

04:22.780 --> 04:23.260
You...

04:24.700 --> 04:26.660
You're an unloved princess.

04:27.740 --> 04:30.100
(This fool is indeed easy to deceive.)

04:31.660 --> 04:32.900
My mother and I...

04:33.540 --> 04:34.500
We

04:34.780 --> 04:36.660
have been marginalized
since I was a child.

04:37.660 --> 04:40.390
We couldn't even scrape together
enough money for my brother's wedding.

04:40.580 --> 04:42.420
My mother's health is also poor.

04:44.020 --> 04:45.500
What a miserable princess.

04:56.220 --> 04:56.900
This

04:57.060 --> 04:57.940
is the down payment.

04:58.780 --> 05:00.220
Go and prepare the contract.

05:00.420 --> 05:00.860
Wait.

05:02.100 --> 05:03.020
What is this?

05:03.020 --> 05:04.210
You're using this as a down payment?

05:04.220 --> 05:05.600
What do you mean by "what is this"?

05:05.780 --> 05:08.540
This is a precious gemstone
brought as tribute from abroad.

05:08.740 --> 05:10.540
Even the smallest one is worth 15 guan.

05:11.300 --> 05:13.210
I don't blame you
for not knowing their value.

05:14.100 --> 05:15.660
Isn't this just glass?

05:15.740 --> 05:17.220
Can you have some dignity?

05:17.460 --> 05:18.980
You've been swindled by glass,

05:18.980 --> 05:20.060
and you call them gemstones?

05:20.220 --> 05:21.740
They're just picked up from a volcano.

05:21.940 --> 05:23.100
They aren't worth much.

05:23.500 --> 05:26.140
If you want them, I'll give you a few
carts in a couple of days.

05:27.700 --> 05:29.420
I won't waste any more words

05:29.420 --> 05:30.340
on someone so ignorant.

05:30.940 --> 05:31.460
I...

05:31.580 --> 05:33.020
I'm ignorant?

05:33.020 --> 05:33.460
You...

05:35.380 --> 05:35.860
Wait.

05:36.620 --> 05:37.420
Are you saying

05:37.820 --> 05:39.420
that even the smallest piece of glass

05:39.580 --> 05:40.620
is worth 15 guan?

05:40.820 --> 05:41.620
Of course.

05:42.100 --> 05:43.660
(If I just make some glass,)

05:43.660 --> 05:45.060
(won't I make a fortune?)

05:46.760 --> 05:47.340
How about this?

05:47.940 --> 05:49.300
You give me one thousand guan,

05:49.300 --> 05:50.180
and we'll partner up.

05:50.420 --> 05:51.500
You provide the venue

05:51.500 --> 05:53.400
and have the Ministry of Works
build me some machines.

05:53.500 --> 05:54.620
Stuff like this?

05:54.980 --> 05:56.300
We can have as much as we want.

05:57.780 --> 05:59.180
Who brags like you do?

05:59.800 --> 06:01.990
If you don't want to sell
your restaurant, just say so.

06:02.140 --> 06:04.180
Why make up nonsense to deceive me?

06:05.860 --> 06:07.540
I'm not so bored that I'd lie to you.

06:08.140 --> 06:09.060
Believe it or not.

06:09.300 --> 06:09.980
I'll earn

06:10.180 --> 06:11.180
the money myself.

06:16.540 --> 06:17.020
Fine.

06:17.460 --> 06:18.660
One thousand guan it is.

06:19.260 --> 06:20.540
But let's be clear.

06:20.740 --> 06:22.220
If this stuff doesn't make money,

06:22.260 --> 06:24.490
half the shares of Juxian Restaurant
will belong to me.

06:25.140 --> 06:25.380
Eat.

06:25.980 --> 06:27.980
This restaurant's business is too good.

06:27.980 --> 06:29.620
We've been waiting for over an hour.

06:31.540 --> 06:32.580
Look, Young Madam.

06:35.140 --> 06:35.940
Done?

06:36.580 --> 06:37.380
It's on the house.

06:38.180 --> 06:39.220
As I said before,

06:39.380 --> 06:40.860
it's free as long as you come to eat.

06:41.140 --> 06:42.700
It's our own family's restaurant.

06:45.620 --> 06:46.460
You little rascal.

06:46.460 --> 06:47.300
No, wait, Aunt.

06:47.300 --> 06:48.900
I had to wait forever
for a meal, didn't I?

06:48.900 --> 06:49.780
Aunt, it hurts.

06:49.780 --> 06:50.460
It hurts, let go.

06:50.460 --> 06:51.060
It's falling off.

06:51.060 --> 06:52.580
If it falls off,
I won't be able to get a wife.

06:55.980 --> 06:56.780
Wait...

06:57.000 --> 06:58.980
How can you not know
your own family's restaurant?

06:58.980 --> 06:59.940
You insisted on waiting in line,

06:59.940 --> 07:00.780
and yet you blame me?

07:00.820 --> 07:02.180
Couldn't you just come straight in?

07:02.780 --> 07:03.220
How...

07:04.340 --> 07:07.100
How was I supposed to know
this restaurant belongs to us?

07:08.660 --> 07:10.260
You're the head of the house,

07:10.540 --> 07:11.860
yet you don't even know

07:11.860 --> 07:12.780
if this place is ours.

07:12.800 --> 07:13.940
And you think you're in the right?

07:13.940 --> 07:14.380
You even...

07:14.380 --> 07:15.740
You even pulled my ear.

07:15.740 --> 07:16.420
Young Madam,

07:16.420 --> 07:17.220
you're here.

07:17.940 --> 07:18.740
Go, go.

07:18.900 --> 07:20.660
Clear out a private room
upstairs for Young Madam.

07:20.660 --> 07:21.020
Yes, sir.

07:21.020 --> 07:22.300
Young Madam, please this way.

07:23.700 --> 07:25.380
You've really made something
of yourself.

07:25.420 --> 07:26.420
You're quite capable now.

07:26.940 --> 07:27.420
Please.

07:27.820 --> 07:29.540
(How could a place this booming)

07:29.740 --> 07:31.660
(be run by this fool?)

07:35.780 --> 07:36.580
Mother,

07:37.100 --> 07:38.340
these gemstones

07:38.420 --> 07:39.980
are products of nature.

07:40.620 --> 07:42.420
Can Wei the Fool really create them?

07:43.300 --> 07:45.060
(Empress of the Great Yong Dynasty)
Running a restaurant is actually hard.

07:45.460 --> 07:46.620
Most aren't profitable.

07:46.620 --> 07:48.540
Many who open restaurants in the capital

07:48.660 --> 07:50.180
struggle to find their footing.

07:50.860 --> 07:51.860
But not only did Wei Hao

07:52.060 --> 07:53.220
open one,

07:53.420 --> 07:54.940
but it's also very successful.

07:55.300 --> 07:56.700
So, Mother, you mean...

07:56.780 --> 07:58.260
If those gemstones he mentioned

07:59.020 --> 08:00.380
can be manufactured,

08:00.380 --> 08:01.740
we should give it a try.

08:02.660 --> 08:04.660
The deficit in the imperial treasury

08:05.020 --> 08:06.860
is estimated to reach
40,000 guan this year.

08:07.680 --> 08:08.940
Great Yong was just established,

08:08.940 --> 08:10.300
and the national treasury is empty.

08:10.340 --> 08:12.580
Your father is also facing
many difficulties.

08:12.900 --> 08:13.700
Besides,

08:13.860 --> 08:15.700
if your workshop doesn't succeed,

08:16.060 --> 08:18.580
Wei Hao has to give you
half the shares of Juxian Restaurant.

08:19.180 --> 08:21.020
We won't suffer any loss.

08:23.980 --> 08:25.980
(Wei Mansion)

08:33.380 --> 08:34.380
Aunt,

08:35.180 --> 08:36.220
why did you come in?

08:36.900 --> 08:37.980
To scrub your back.

08:39.060 --> 08:39.860
Hao,

08:40.020 --> 08:41.900
based on Juxian Restaurant's
current revenue,

08:41.940 --> 08:44.060
can we return to
the Wei ancestral home soon?

08:46.520 --> 08:48.360
Is there no distinction
between men and women?

08:48.740 --> 08:50.380
I've bathed you since you were little.

08:50.700 --> 08:51.500
Lean forward a bit.

08:51.500 --> 08:52.460
I'll help you with the bath beans.

08:52.460 --> 08:53.260
Lean forward?

08:57.420 --> 08:58.220
Perhaps

08:58.580 --> 09:00.460
we could even buy a new mansion.

09:03.260 --> 09:04.460
That tickles, it tickles.

09:04.940 --> 09:05.500
It tickles.

09:06.500 --> 09:07.580
How about I do it myself?

09:07.580 --> 09:09.100
You never wash properly on your own.

09:09.260 --> 09:11.140
I always have to re-wash you anyway.

09:11.580 --> 09:13.340
Am I really that silly?

09:14.860 --> 09:16.180
(Poor Hao.)

09:16.300 --> 09:18.220
(You don't even
know how foolish you are.)

09:22.500 --> 09:23.500
You can stand up now.

09:24.580 --> 09:25.380
No...

09:25.700 --> 09:27.060
I'll do the bottom part myself.

09:29.380 --> 09:30.380
You

09:30.700 --> 09:31.660
have grown up.

09:43.220 --> 09:44.180
That scared me.

09:58.940 --> 10:00.060
What's this?

10:01.260 --> 10:02.100
A massage?

10:02.580 --> 10:03.380
Lie down.

10:05.300 --> 10:06.980
Well, I do like massages.

10:12.100 --> 10:13.500
You've been exhausted lately, right?

10:13.700 --> 10:15.140
Let me help you relax.

10:19.060 --> 10:19.540
Ouch.

10:20.140 --> 10:20.820
Ouch...

10:20.820 --> 10:22.140
Why are you walking on my back?

10:24.660 --> 10:26.220
Is it because I've gained weight lately?

10:26.580 --> 10:27.860
Then, I'll use more strength.

10:31.700 --> 10:32.980
This is quite comfortable.

10:44.780 --> 10:46.700
(She might not be my biological aunt,)

10:46.900 --> 10:49.540
(but she treats a fool like me
with such genuine kindness.)

10:53.580 --> 10:54.380
Does it feel good?

10:56.140 --> 10:57.140
Yes, it does.

10:58.220 --> 11:01.260
(Ganlu Palace)

11:01.860 --> 11:03.820
Envoy, what is the meaning of this?

11:04.860 --> 11:06.820
We request that Your Majesty,

11:07.020 --> 11:10.300
the Emperor of the Great Yong,
provide 60 million kg worth of grain.

11:10.540 --> 11:12.340
Our empire does not
have that much grain.

11:12.700 --> 11:14.380
The Northwest
suffered a drought this year.

11:15.180 --> 11:16.820
(The Emperor of the Great Yong)
Great Yong is also facing a grain shortage.

11:17.260 --> 11:18.540
We don't have that much grain

11:18.540 --> 11:20.020
to give to your Beicang.

11:20.660 --> 11:21.340
(Beicang Envoy)
However,

11:21.980 --> 11:22.940
you could certainly

11:22.940 --> 11:24.540
buy it from the common people.

11:25.220 --> 11:26.420
If there is nothing else,

11:26.420 --> 11:27.420
you may all withdraw.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.980
The Court of Diplomatic Affairs
will see to you.

11:29.980 --> 11:30.990
Please wait, Your Majesty.

11:36.460 --> 11:37.020
Your Majesty,

11:37.380 --> 11:38.340
I am Duo Xiang,

11:38.340 --> 11:39.940
a Hu merchant traveling
between the grasslands and the West.

11:40.100 --> 11:41.140
Entrusted by Beicang,

11:41.140 --> 11:42.380
I am here to coordinate trade.

11:42.940 --> 11:44.980
(Duo Xiang, Hu Merchant)
While we lack the wealth of Great Yong,

11:45.180 --> 11:45.980
we

11:46.180 --> 11:47.180
have gemstones.

11:56.060 --> 11:57.620
I ask Your Majesty

11:57.620 --> 11:59.740
to allow us to use
the money from these gemstones

11:59.740 --> 12:00.740
to purchase grain.

12:00.740 --> 12:02.260
Such beautiful gemstones.

12:06.260 --> 12:07.020
This time,

12:07.020 --> 12:09.060
we have brought
two carts full of these gems.

12:09.060 --> 12:10.380
Two carts of gemstones?

12:11.020 --> 12:12.100
That many?

12:13.420 --> 12:14.660
(Zhangsun Ying, Left Chancellor of the Great Yong)
They must be worth a fortune.

12:14.660 --> 12:15.540
(Cheng Sanfu, Duke of the Great Yong)

12:16.020 --> 12:17.940
Look, it is indeed as said.

12:18.220 --> 12:19.780
Isn't this just glass?

12:19.780 --> 12:21.220
Can you have some dignity?

12:21.460 --> 12:23.620
You're being fooled by glass.

12:23.660 --> 12:24.780
"Gemstones", really?

12:24.800 --> 12:26.460
Weren't these just
picked up from a volcano?

12:26.700 --> 12:27.620
They're dirt cheap.

12:28.020 --> 12:28.940
If you want them,

12:29.160 --> 12:30.980
I'll give you a few
carts in a couple of days.

12:31.660 --> 12:32.460
Your Majesty,

12:32.540 --> 12:34.500
these gemstones are dazzling tokens

12:34.500 --> 12:35.660
offered to all living beings

12:35.660 --> 12:37.460
after Han'er Volcano spews lava.

12:37.460 --> 12:38.740
They are a blessing from heaven.

12:39.180 --> 12:40.540
In our grasslands,

12:40.540 --> 12:42.060
each one is worth 15 guan.

12:42.380 --> 12:44.820
Now, we are willing to sell
them to Your Majesty

12:44.820 --> 12:45.940
for only ten guan each.

12:47.420 --> 12:49.420
We have a total of
ten thousand such gems.

12:49.460 --> 12:51.180
We wish to use the hundred thousand guan

12:51.380 --> 12:52.700
to purchase grain in Great Yong.

12:53.060 --> 12:55.420
We wonder what Your Majesty thinks?

12:57.500 --> 12:59.020
(Ten guan)

12:59.420 --> 13:00.780
(for such fine gemstones)

13:01.300 --> 13:02.660
(is really not expensive.)

13:03.460 --> 13:05.300
(If what Wei the Fool says is true,)

13:05.660 --> 13:06.700
(the Great Yong)

13:06.860 --> 13:08.580
(will be giving up hundreds
of thousands of kg of grain)

13:08.860 --> 13:10.580
(in exchange for these cheap stones.)

13:11.660 --> 13:12.300
(No.)

13:13.020 --> 13:14.060
What gemstones?

13:16.380 --> 13:17.980
They are nothing but cheap goods.

13:22.500 --> 13:23.340
You

13:23.700 --> 13:25.180
must be the Princess.

13:26.580 --> 13:28.820
As expected of
the Eldest Princess of Great Yong.

13:28.860 --> 13:32.980
Your beauty is as delicate and fragile
as the Central Plains peony.

13:35.620 --> 13:37.500
A peony may be delicate,
but it has character.

13:38.100 --> 13:39.380
Unlike some common items

13:39.500 --> 13:41.580
that are insistently claimed
to be rare treasures.

13:42.100 --> 13:43.420
Your Highness,

13:43.700 --> 13:46.260
please do not insult
our precious and noble gemstones.

13:46.260 --> 13:46.980
Ning'an,

13:48.060 --> 13:49.300
what do you mean by that?

13:50.260 --> 13:51.340
Father, please see clearly.

13:51.980 --> 13:53.660
In our vast and
resource-rich Great Yong,

13:53.660 --> 13:54.990
these things can be found anywhere.

13:55.420 --> 13:56.540
I can produce these items

13:57.020 --> 13:59.380
as many as I want.

14:03.220 --> 14:04.180
Then, we shall

14:04.220 --> 14:06.580
wait for the Your Highness's gemstones.

14:17.540 --> 14:20.380
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

14:20.980 --> 14:24.380
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

14:25.140 --> 14:28.100
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

14:28.460 --> 14:31.140
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:32.740 --> 14:36.220
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:36.220 --> 14:38.460
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:38.460 --> 14:40.540
♪Colors and darkness♪

14:40.540 --> 14:42.580
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:42.580 --> 14:46.940
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:48.380 --> 14:52.100
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

14:52.380 --> 14:55.980
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

14:56.140 --> 14:58.220
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:58.220 --> 15:03.020
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

15:03.220 --> 15:04.860
♪The world mistakes me♪

15:04.860 --> 15:07.180
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

15:07.260 --> 15:08.460
♪As the storm approaches♪

15:08.460 --> 15:10.860
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

15:11.060 --> 15:12.780
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

15:12.780 --> 15:14.740
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

15:14.940 --> 15:16.660
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

15:16.660 --> 15:18.780
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

15:18.780 --> 15:20.260
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

15:20.260 --> 15:22.460
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

15:22.700 --> 15:23.900
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

15:23.900 --> 15:26.420
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

15:26.540 --> 15:28.260
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

15:28.260 --> 15:29.540
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

15:29.700 --> 15:31.100
♪My wish has finally come true♪

15:31.100 --> 15:32.140
♪To stay by your side♪

15:32.140 --> 15:34.060
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:34.220 --> 15:37.500
♪We are free and happy♪

15:41.500 --> 15:43.260
♪From a nobody♪

15:43.260 --> 15:45.180
♪To someone now famous♪

15:45.260 --> 15:46.700
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

15:46.700 --> 15:49.220
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

15:49.300 --> 15:50.900
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

15:50.900 --> 15:52.980
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

15:53.180 --> 15:54.860
♪In this vast world♪

15:54.860 --> 15:56.860
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:57.020 --> 15:59.220
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:59.220 --> 16:00.820
♪Everything ends eventually♪

16:00.900 --> 16:02.380
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

16:02.380 --> 16:04.780
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

16:04.780 --> 16:06.500
♪No matter how time flies♪

16:06.500 --> 16:07.660
♪Even if the falling snow♪

16:07.660 --> 16:09.300
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

16:09.300 --> 16:10.340
♪All I want now♪

16:10.340 --> 16:12.420
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

16:12.420 --> 16:15.700
♪Year after year♪
